# Smart punctuation becomes ASCII, 608 accented letters are kept, other
# Latin letters fall back to the base letter, emoji are stripped.
ticks 100 6000
at 1000 final "It’s “GG” — nice… 🎉 café naïve Łódź" start=0 end=1000
---
1000 "It's \"GG\" -- nice...\ncafé naïve Lódz"
5000 ""
stat stripped_chars 1
